wnc2h5bwcdyzrn.jpg"}, {"id": 21715, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/yxm6t7tdo9aioz3j2aqv.jpg"}], "slug": "advanced-busterhawk-gley-lancer", "summary": "Advanced Busterhawk Gley Lancer, commonly known as Gleylancer (\u30b0\u30ec\u30a4\u30e9\u30f3\u30b5\u30fc), is a 1992 Sega Mega Drive shoot-'em-up by NCS released exclusively in Japan (despite having some of its text, such as in the Mover configuration screen described below, in near-perfect English). It was released internationally on the Wii Virtual Console in 2008. Despite the English configuration screen, translation group M.I.J.E.T. released a patch which translated the story text in 2006-2007.\n\nLucia is the 16-year-old daughter of a fighter pilot who disappears while fighting a war between humans and aliens in 2025. He was captured by aliens whom he had captured earlier who had the ability to teleport. Lucia hijacks the prototype fighter CSH-01-XA \"Gley Lancer\" to save him.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/advanced-busterhawk-gley-lancer", "videos": [{"id": 161577, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "0ilPiq_9TAo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ilPiq_9TAo", "title": "Gley Lancer Longplay (Sega Genesis) [QHD] [JP]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0ilPiq_9TAo/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}